    "heightBasis": "No qualified native architectural height. Working roof30.4m above original field datum, opaque wing underside27.1..30.15m, facade6..25m, lower seats1.5..11.2m/upper15.2..26m and raised southern upper bank22.3..26m over projecting hospitality belt11.2..22m are photograph-led allocations. Service cabin31..34.7m, rows/framing/solar partitions/aisles/entry flights are approximate. The inner translucent strip is approximately eight metres wide; image-free55percent-alpha PBR approximates its transmission. Published2005–2013 material defines an historical completed reference, not present condition. No precise survey, engineering, access, optical or working solar/electrical certification.",
    "terrainBasis": "Original standard6m Mapzen grid, roads, water and all independent buildings are retained. Datum556.6123752579924m defines field/modelY0. Boundary original samples span-2.870661703437804..2.5407756651422915m. Own retaining base extends below minimum grade; bounded ground opening remains inside that occupied base at every level. External supports meet individual sampled original grades. Only stadium parent52776562948269 is replaced with99.5percent whole-feature coverage; generalized lower levels use bounded area clipping. Failure/unload retains/restores original terrain/context.",
